<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates close steady, seen stable.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates close steady, seen stable.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed steady on Monday on low demand from yarn users and are likely to remain stable this week, dealers said.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21</p>
<p>counts:			    Monday	May 8</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     470	   470</p>
<p>    Din Textile		  470	   470</p>
<p>    Popular			455	   455</p>
<p>($1 = 40.43 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
